        helpStoryButtons: "On each chapter, Go to this date moves the slider to it, Pin to slider date pins it to where the slider is now, Move up and Move down change the order, In the show or Hidden keeps it in the list but out of the show, and Remove chapter drops it. Remove all empties the list. After a run, Use rehearsed timings turns the time you spent on each chapter into its hold time.",
